#, no-wrap
msgid "Refer to the [API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/parity-twine-optimizer) for full details of the input to and output from the Parity Twine Optimizer function.\n"
msgstr "Parity Twine Optimizer関数の入力と出力の詳細については、[APIリファレンス](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/parity-twine-optimizer)を参照してください。\n"

